{
  "about": "Shared vectors for psyche-machine:v1 (TS parseMachineLink here; the Rust helper's parser in H2 must agree). A case builds the link psyche-machine:v1: + base64url(no padding) of JSON. With `url`, the JSON is {gatewayUrl: url, gatewayKey: $KEY, [certPin: $PIN when pin], setupToken: $TOKEN, hostName: 'H'}; with `body`, the JSON text is used as written ($KEY, $TOKEN and $PIN are substituted first). `accept` cases must parse and return `gatewayUrl` as URL.origin; `refuse` cases must be refused (`problem` where it is fixed).",
  "constants": {
    "KEY": "AwMDAwMDAwMDAwMDAwMDAwMDAwMDAwMDAwMDAwMDAwM",
    "TOKEN": "pst_BwcHBwcHBwcHBwcHBwcHBwcHBwcHBwcHBwcHBwcHBwc",
    "PIN": "CQkJCQkJCQkJCQkJCQkJCQkJCQkJCQkJCQkJCQkJCQk"
  },
  "cases": [
